
### Register a GameFlix user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gameflixtest@example.com",
  "username": "TestGamer",
  "password": "GameFlixTest123!"
}
### Try registering the same email again
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gameflixtest@example.com",
  "username": "AnotherGamer",
  "password": "DifferentTest123!"
}
### Log in to GameFlix
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gameflixtest@example.com",
  "password": "GameFlixTest123!"
}
### Login with incorrect password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gameflixtest@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}

### Get profile without a token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me

### Get profile with a token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJnYW1lZmxpeHRlc3RAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJ1c2VySWQiOjEsImlhdCI6MTc5MjM4NTEzNywiZXhwIjoxNzkyMzg2MDM3fQ.CukfpzZ0gVrhFi5gZ3O5fv0JyQMlDBr17HY-0_o1n6k

### Get profile with an invalid token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer this-is-not-a-valid-token

